# === DATE PERSONALE — cel mai important bloc din acest fisier ===
# CV-ul, baza de date cu anunturi si cache-ul contin date personale si
# continut preluat de la terti. Nimic din data/ nu are ce cauta in git.
data/**
!data/.gitkeep
!data/cv/.gitkeep
!data/cache/.gitkeep
!data/exports/.gitkeep
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.pdf
*.docx

# Mediu si secrete
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.key
*.pem

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# Medii virtuale
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/

# Unelte
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
.hypothesis/

# Documente interne de lucru — raman local
intent.md
spec.md
plan.md
TASKS.md
CLAUDE.md
docs/

# Referinte personale
inspiratie/

